Day 01 — Linux User Management
Completed my first hands-on task as part of the 100 Days of DevOps journey on KodeKloud.
Objective
Create a Linux user named anita with a non-interactive shell on App Server 1.
Command Executed
sudo useradd -s /sbin/nologin anita

Verification
grep '^anita:' /etc/passwd

Key Learnings
- Linux user management
- User creation using useradd
- Non-interactive shell configuration
- Remote server access using SSH
- Privilege escalation using sudo
